  "description": "⭐ <em>Hop aboard the </em><strong><em>Peppa Pig Afternoon Tea London Sightseeing Bus Tour </em></strong><em>from Brigit’s Bakery for a fun-filled ride through London’s most iconic sights. With sweet treats, entertainment, and plenty of family fun, it’s an experience little ones won’t forget.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🐷 Enjoy a Peppa Pig-themed afternoon tea menu for all ages<br>\r\n🚌 Discover iconic London landmarks from a vintage double-decker<br>\r\n🎶 Sing along and play games with a lively onboard entertainer<br>\r\n🎁 Take home themed souvenirs and an activity book for added fun<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Dietary Requirements</strong><br>\r\n<strong>🚩After booking, you’ll be asked to select your menu and share any dietary requirements. Please double-check your choices, as they cannot be changed once submitted.🚩</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n🎉 <strong>Looking for even more Peppa Pig fun in London? Don’t miss these special seasonal bus tours packed with themed treats, entertainment, and unforgettable moments for the whole family:</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>🎃 Peppa Pig Halloween Sightseeing Bus Tour</strong> – Hop aboard for a spook-tacular ride through London with festive fun, playful surprises, and Halloween-themed delights. Book your tickets <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/599654?thm=12311\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here.</a><br>\r\n<strong>🎄 Peppa Pig Christmas Sightseeing Bus Tour</strong> – Experience London’s magical Christmas lights with seasonal treats, joyful entertainment, and plenty of holiday cheer. Book your tickets <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/599365?thm=12311\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here.</a><br>\r\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for Peppa Pig Afternoon Tea London Sightseeing Bus Tour <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/646728\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 1 hour and 30 minutes<br>\r\n📍 <strong>Departure: </strong><strong>Temple (Bus Stop N), Victoria Embankment, by Temple Tube Station</strong><br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: 2+<br>\r\n❗<strong>&nbsp;Any allergies must be emailed and confirmed by management at bus@b-bakery.com&nbsp;</strong>❗<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: please refer to the <a href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/plan/faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">FAQs</a><br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://b-bakery.com/london/bus-tours/peppa-pig-afternoon-tea\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nClimb aboard a charming double-decker for a Peppa Pig–themed afternoon tea through London’s iconic streets. Delight in a playful menu crafted for little ones and grown-ups alike, while onboard entertainment, sing-alongs, and interactive tablets bring the journey to life. With famous landmarks passing by and themed keepsakes to take home, it’s a magical family outing full of flavour and fun. Get your tickets for <em>Peppa Pig Afternoon Tea London Sightseeing Bus Tour</em>&nbsp;in London!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n©&nbsp;2026&nbsp;ABD&nbsp;Ltd/ Hasbro/HCPL&nbsp;Ltd.",
